      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"1\" type=\"品\">1 世主妙嚴品</cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"4\" type=\"品\">之四</cb:mulu><cb:div type=\"pin\">\r\n<milestone n=\"5\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c01\">0021c01</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c02\">0021c02</span><cb:juan n=\"005\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"005\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大方廣佛華嚴經</title>卷第五</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c03\">0021c03</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c04\">0021c04</span><byline><anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0021c01\"/>于闐國三<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0021c02\"/>藏實叉難陀<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0021c03\"/>奉　制譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c05\">0021c05</span><cb:div><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"5\" type=\"品\">之五</cb:mulu><head>世主妙嚴品第一之五</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c06\">0021c06</span><p>復次，普賢菩薩摩訶薩，入不思議解脫門方\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c07\">0021c07</span>便海，入如來功德海。所謂：有解脫門，名：嚴\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c08\">0021c08</span>淨一切佛國土調伏眾生令究竟出離。有解\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c09\">0021c09</span>脫門，名：普詣一切如來所修具足功德境界。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c10\">0021c10</span>有解脫門，名：安立一切菩薩地諸大願海。有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c11\">0021c11</span>解脫門，名：普現法界微塵數無量身。有解脫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c12\">0021c12</span>門，名：演說遍一切國土不可思議數差別名。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c13\">0021c13</span>有解脫門，名：一切微塵中悉現無邊諸菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c14\">0021c14</span>神通境界。有解脫門，名：一念中現三世劫成\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c15\">0021c15</span>壞事。有解脫門，名：示現一切菩薩諸根海各\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c16\">0021c16</span>入自境界。有解脫門，名：能以神通力化現種\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c17\">0021c17</span>種身遍無邊法界。有解脫門，名：顯示一切菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c18\">0021c18</span>薩修行法次第門入一切智廣大方便。</p><p>爾時，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c19\">0021c19</span>普賢菩薩摩訶薩，以自功德，復承如來威神\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c20\">0021c20</span>之力，普觀一切眾會海已，即說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c21\">0021c21</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「佛所莊嚴廣大剎，<caesura/>等於一切微塵數，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c22\">0021c22</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨佛子悉滿中，<caesura/>雨不思議最妙法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c23\">0021c23</span><p class=\"lg\">如於此會見佛坐，<caesura/>一切塵中悉如是，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c24\">0021c24</span><p class=\"lg\">佛身無去亦無來，<caesura/>所有國土皆明現。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c25\">0021c25</span><p class=\"lg\">顯示菩薩所修行，<caesura/>無量趣地諸方便，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c26\">0021c26</span><p class=\"lg\">及說難思真實理，<caesura/>令諸佛子入法界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c27\">0021c27</span><p class=\"lg\">出生化佛如塵數，<caesura/>普應群生心所欲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c28\">0021c28</span><p class=\"lg\">入深法界方便門，<caesura/>廣大無邊悉開演。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0021c29\">0021c29</span><p class=\"lg\">如來名號等世間，<caesura/>十方國土悉充<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0021003\">遍＝滿【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0021003\">遍【大】，滿【宮】</span><app n=\"0021003\"><p class=\"lg\">遍</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">滿</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a01\">0022a01</span><p class=\"lg\">一切方便無空過，<caesura/>調伏眾生皆離垢。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a02\">0022a02</span><p class=\"lg\">佛於一切微塵中，<caesura/>示現無邊大神力，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a03\">0022a03</span><p class=\"lg\">悉坐道場能演說，<caesura/>如佛往昔菩提行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a04\">0022a04</span><p class=\"lg\">三世所有廣大劫，<caesura/>佛念念中皆示現，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a05\">0022a05</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸成壞一切事，<caesura/>不思議智無不了。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a06\">0022a06</span><p class=\"lg\">佛子眾會廣無限，<caesura/>欲共測量諸佛地，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a07\">0022a07</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛法門無有邊，<caesura/>能悉了<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0022a0701\">知【CB】【麗-CB】【磧-CB】，智【大】</span><app n=\"0022a0701\"><p class=\"lg\">知<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_po451a10</note><note type=\"cf2\">Q07_p0718c04</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">智</rdg></app>甚為難。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a08\">0022a08</span><p class=\"lg\">佛如虛空無分別，<caesura/>等真法界無所依，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a09\">0022a09</span><p class=\"lg\">化現周行靡不至，<caesura/>悉坐道場成正覺。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a10\">0022a10</span><p class=\"lg\">佛以妙音廣宣暢，<caesura/>一切諸地皆明了，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a11\">0022a11</span><p class=\"lg\">普現一一眾生前，<caesura/>盡與如來平等法。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a12\">0022a12</span><p>復次，淨德妙光菩薩摩訶薩，得遍往十方菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a13\">0022a13</span>薩眾會莊嚴道場解脫門；普德最勝燈光照\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a14\">0022a14</span>菩薩摩訶薩，得一念中現無盡成正覺門教\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a15\">0022a15</span>化成熟不思議眾生界解脫門；普光師子幢\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a16\">0022a16</span>菩薩摩訶薩，得修習菩薩福德莊嚴出生一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a17\">0022a17</span>切佛國土解脫門；普寶焰妙光菩薩摩訶薩，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a18\">0022a18</span>得觀察佛神通境界無迷惑解脫門；普音功\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a19\">0022a19</span>德海幢菩薩摩訶薩，得於一眾會道場中示\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a20\">0022a20</span>現一切佛土莊嚴解脫門；普智光照如來境\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a21\">0022a21</span>菩薩摩訶薩，得隨逐如來觀察甚深廣大法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a22\">0022a22</span>界藏解脫<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0022001\">門＋（普覺悅意聲菩薩摩訶薩得親近承事一切諸佛供養藏解脫門）二十五字【元】【明】【宮】，但元本無諸之字，明註曰南藏無諸之字</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0022001\">門普覺悅意聲菩薩摩訶薩得親近承事一切諸佛供養藏解脫門【CB】【明】【宮】，門【大】，門普覺悅意聲菩薩摩訶薩得親近承事一切佛供養藏解脫門【元】，明註曰南藏無諸之字</span><app n=\"0022001\"><p class=\"lg\">門；普覺悅意聲菩薩摩訶薩，得親近承事一切諸佛供養藏解脫門</lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">門</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】\">門普覺悅意聲菩薩摩訶薩得親近承事一切佛供養藏解脫門</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】 【宮】\">門普覺悅意聲菩薩摩訶薩得親近承事一切諸佛供養藏解脫門</rdg><rdg resp=\"【明】\" wit=\"【南藏】\">門普覺悅意聲菩薩摩訶薩得親近承事一切佛供養藏解脫門</rdg></app>；普清淨無盡福威光菩薩摩訶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a23\">0022a23</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0022002\">薩＋（得出世一切神變廣大加持解脫門普寶髻華幢菩薩摩訶薩）【元】【明】【宮】，但宮本無華幢二字</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0022002\">薩得出生一切神變廣大加持解脫門；普寶髻華幢菩薩摩訶薩【CB】【磧-CB】，薩【大】，薩得出世一切神變廣大加持解脫門普寶髻華幢菩薩摩訶薩【元】【明】，薩得出世一切神變廣大加持解脫門普寶髻菩薩摩訶薩【宮】</span><app n=\"0022002\"><p class=\"lg\">薩，得出生一切神變廣大加持解脫門；普寶髻華幢菩薩摩訶薩<note type=\"cf1\">Q023n0082_p0050a03</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">薩</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">薩得出世一切神變廣大加持解脫門普寶髻華幢菩薩摩訶薩</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">薩得出世一切神變廣大加持解脫門普寶髻菩薩摩訶薩</rdg></app>，得普入一切世間行出生菩薩無邊行門\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a24\">0022a24</span>解脫門；普相最勝光菩薩摩訶薩，得能於無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a25\">0022a25</span>相法界中出現一切諸佛境界解脫門。</p><p>爾時，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a26\">0022a26</span>淨德妙光菩薩摩訶薩，承佛威力，普觀一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a27\">0022a27</span>菩薩解脫門海已，即說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a28\">0022a28</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「十方所有諸國土，<caesura/>一剎那中悉嚴淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022a29\">0022a29</span><p class=\"lg\">以妙音聲轉法輪，<caesura/>普遍世間無與等。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b01\">0022b01</span><p class=\"lg\">如來境界無邊際，<caesura/>一念法界悉充滿，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b02\">0022b02</span><p class=\"lg\">一一塵中建道場，<caesura/>悉證菩提起神變。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b03\">0022b03</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊往昔修諸行，<caesura/>經於百千無量劫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b04\">0022b04</span><p class=\"lg\">一切佛剎皆莊嚴，<caesura/>出現無礙如虛空。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b05\">0022b05</span><p class=\"lg\">佛神通力無限量，<caesura/>充滿無邊一切劫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b06\">0022b06</span><p class=\"lg\">假使經於無量劫，<caesura/>念念觀察無疲厭。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b07\">0022b07</span><p class=\"lg\">汝應觀佛神通境，<caesura/>十方國土皆嚴淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b08\">0022b08</span><p class=\"lg\">一切於此悉現前，<caesura/>念念不同無量種。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b09\">0022b09</span><p class=\"lg\">觀佛百千無量劫，<caesura/>不得一毛之分限，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b10\">0022b10</span><p class=\"lg\">如來無礙方便門，<caesura/>此光普照難思剎。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b11\">0022b11</span><p class=\"lg\">如來往劫在世間，<caesura/>承事無邊諸佛海，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b12\">0022b12</span><p class=\"lg\">是故一切如川騖，<caesura/>咸來供養世所尊。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b13\">0022b13</span><p class=\"lg\">如來出現遍十方，<caesura/>一一塵中無量土，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b14\">0022b14</span><p class=\"lg\">其中境界皆無量，<caesura/>悉住無邊無盡劫。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b15\">0022b15</span><p class=\"lg\">佛於曩劫為眾生，<caesura/>修習無邊大悲海，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b16\">0022b16</span><p class=\"lg\">隨諸眾生入生死，<caesura/>普化眾會令清淨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b17\">0022b17</span><p class=\"lg\">佛住真如法界藏，<caesura/>無相無形離諸垢，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b18\">0022b18</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生觀見種種身，<caesura/>一切苦難皆<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0022003\">消＝銷【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0022003\">消【大】，銷【宮】</span><app n=\"0022003\"><p class=\"lg\">消</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">銷</rdg></app>滅。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b19\">0022b19</span><p>復次，海月光大明菩薩摩訶薩，得出生菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b20\">0022b20</span>諸地諸波羅蜜教化眾生及嚴淨一切佛國土\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b21\">0022b21</span>方便解脫門；雲音海光離垢藏菩薩摩訶薩，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b22\">0022b22</span>得念念中普入法界種種差別處解脫門；智\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b23\">0022b23</span>生寶髻菩薩摩訶薩，得不可思議劫於一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b24\">0022b24</span>眾生前現清淨大功德解脫門；功德自在王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b25\">0022b25</span>淨光菩薩摩訶薩，得普見十方一切菩薩初\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b26\">0022b26</span>詣道場時種種莊嚴解脫門；善勇猛蓮華髻\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b27\">0022b27</span>菩薩摩訶薩，得隨諸眾生根解海普為顯示\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b28\">0022b28</span>一切佛法解脫門；普智雲日幢菩薩摩訶薩，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022b29\">0022b29</span>得成就如來智永住無量劫解脫門；大精進\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c01\">0022c01</span>金剛<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0022004\"><g ref=\"#CB00620\"/>＝齊【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0022004\"><g ref=\"#CB00620\"/>【大】，齊【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0022004\"><p class=\"lg\"><g ref=\"#CB00620\"/></lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">齊</rdg></app>菩薩摩訶薩，得普入一切無邊法印\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c02\">0022c02</span>力解脫門；香焰光幢菩薩摩訶薩，得顯示現\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c03\">0022c03</span>在一切佛始修菩薩行乃至成就智慧聚解脫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c04\">0022c04</span>門；大明德深美音菩薩摩訶薩，得安住毘盧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c05\">0022c05</span>遮那一切大願海解脫門；大福光智生菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c06\">0022c06</span>摩訶薩，得顯示如來遍法界甚深境界解脫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c07\">0022c07</span>門。</p><p>爾時，海月光大明菩薩摩訶薩，承佛威\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c08\">0022c08</span>力，普觀一切菩薩眾莊嚴海已，即說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c09\">0022c09</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「諸波羅蜜及諸地，<caesura/>廣大難思悉圓滿，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c10\">0022c10</span><p class=\"lg\">無量眾生盡調伏，<caesura/>一切佛土皆嚴淨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c11\">0022c11</span><p class=\"lg\">如佛教化眾生界，<caesura/>十方國土皆充滿，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c12\">0022c12</span><p class=\"lg\">一念心中轉法輪，<caesura/>普應群情無不遍。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c13\">0022c13</span><p class=\"lg\">佛於無量廣大劫，<caesura/>普現一切眾生前，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c14\">0022c14</span><p class=\"lg\">如其往昔廣修治，<caesura/>示彼所行清淨處。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c15\">0022c15</span><p class=\"lg\">我覩十方無有餘，<caesura/>亦見諸佛現神通，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c16\">0022c16</span><p class=\"lg\">悉坐道場成正覺，<caesura/>眾會聞法共圍遶。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c17\">0022c17</span><p class=\"lg\">廣大光明佛法身，<caesura/>能以方便現世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c18\">0022c18</span><p class=\"lg\">普隨眾生心所樂，<caesura/>悉稱其根而雨法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c19\">0022c19</span><p class=\"lg\">真如平等無相身，<caesura/>離垢光明淨法身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c20\">0022c20</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧寂靜身無量，<caesura/>普應十方而演法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c21\">0022c21</span><p class=\"lg\">法王諸力皆清淨，<caesura/>智慧如空無有邊，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c22\">0022c22</span><p class=\"lg\">悉為開示無遺隱，<caesura/>普使眾生同悟入。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c23\">0022c23</span><p class=\"lg\">如佛往昔所修治，<caesura/>乃至成於一切智，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c24\">0022c24</span><p class=\"lg\">今放光明遍法界，<caesura/>於中顯現悉明了。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c25\">0022c25</span><p class=\"lg\">佛以本願現神通，<caesura/>一切十方無不照，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c26\">0022c26</span><p class=\"lg\">如佛往昔修治行，<caesura/>光明網中皆演說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c27\">0022c27</span><p class=\"lg\">十方境界無有盡，<caesura/>無等無邊各差別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c28\">0022c28</span><p class=\"lg\">佛無礙力發大光，<caesura/>一切國土皆明顯。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0022c29\">0022c29</span><p>爾時，如來師子之座，眾寶、妙華、輪臺、基陛，及\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a01\">0023a01</span>諸戶牖，如是一切莊嚴具中，一一各出佛剎\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a02\">0023a02</span>微塵數菩薩摩訶薩，其名曰：海慧自在神通\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a03\">0023a03</span>王菩薩摩訶薩、雷音普震菩薩摩訶薩、眾寶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a04\">0023a04</span>光明髻菩薩摩訶薩、大智日勇猛慧菩薩摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a05\">0023a05</span>訶薩、不思議功德寶智印菩薩摩訶薩、百目\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a06\">0023a06</span>蓮華髻菩薩摩訶薩、金焰圓滿光菩薩摩訶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a07\">0023a07</span>薩、法界普音菩薩摩訶薩、雲音淨月菩薩摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a08\">0023a08</span>訶薩、善勇猛光明幢菩薩摩訶薩……。如是等而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a09\">0023a09</span>為上首，有眾多佛剎微塵數同時出現。此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a10\">0023a10</span>諸菩薩，各興種種供養雲，所謂：一切摩尼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a11\">0023a11</span>寶華雲、一切蓮華妙香雲、一切寶圓滿光雲、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a12\">0023a12</span>無邊境界香焰雲、日藏摩尼輪光明雲、一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a13\">0023a13</span>悅意樂音雲、無邊色相一切寶燈光焰雲、眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a14\">0023a14</span>寶樹枝華果雲、無盡寶清淨光明摩尼王雲、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a15\">0023a15</span>一切莊嚴具摩尼王雲……。如是等諸供養雲，有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a16\">0023a16</span>佛世界微塵數。彼諸菩薩，一一皆興如是供\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a17\">0023a17</span>養雲，雨於一切道場眾海，相續不絕。現<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0023001\">（如）＋是【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0023001\">是【大】，如是【宮】</span><app n=\"0023001\"><p class=\"lg\">是</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">如是</rdg></app>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a18\">0023a18</span>雲已，右遶世尊，經無量百千匝，隨其方面，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a19\">0023a19</span>去佛不遠，化作無量種種寶蓮華師子之座；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a20\">0023a20</span>各於其上，結跏趺坐。是諸菩薩所行清淨廣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a21\">0023a21</span>大如海，得智慧光照普門法，隨順諸佛，所行\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a22\">0023a22</span>無礙；能入一切辯才法海，得不思議解脫法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a23\">0023a23</span>門，住於如來普門之地；已得一切陀羅尼門，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a24\">0023a24</span>悉能容受一切法海，善住三世平等智地；已\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a25\">0023a25</span>得深信，廣大喜樂，無邊福聚，極善清淨；虛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a26\">0023a26</span>空法界靡不觀察，十方世界一切國土，所有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a27\">0023a27</span>佛興，咸勤供養。</p><p>爾時，海慧自在神通王菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a28\">0023a28</span>摩訶薩，承佛威力，普觀一切道場眾海，即說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023a29\">0023a29</span>頌言：</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b01\">0023b01</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「諸佛所悟悉已知，<caesura/>如空無礙皆明照，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b02\">0023b02</span><p class=\"lg\">光遍十方無量土，<caesura/>處於眾會普嚴潔。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b03\">0023b03</span><p class=\"lg\">如來功德不可量，<caesura/>十方法界悉充滿，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b04\">0023b04</span><p class=\"lg\">普坐一切樹王下，<caesura/>諸大自在共雲集。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b05\">0023b05</span><p class=\"lg\">佛有如是神通力，<caesura/>一念現於無盡相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b06\">0023b06</span><p class=\"lg\">如來境界無有邊，<caesura/>各隨解脫能觀見。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b07\">0023b07</span><p class=\"lg\">如來往昔經劫海，<caesura/>在於諸有勤修行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b08\">0023b08</span><p class=\"lg\">種種方便化眾生，<caesura/>令彼受行諸佛法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b09\">0023b09</span><p class=\"lg\">毘盧遮那具嚴好，<caesura/>坐蓮華藏師子座，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b10\">0023b10</span><p class=\"lg\">一切眾會皆清淨，<caesura/>寂然而住同瞻仰。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b11\">0023b11</span><p class=\"lg\">摩尼寶藏放光明，<caesura/>普發無邊香焰雲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b12\">0023b12</span><p class=\"lg\">無量華<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0023002\">纓＝瓔【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0023002\">纓【大】＊，瓔【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0023002\"><p class=\"lg\">纓</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">瓔</rdg></app>共垂布，<caesura/>如是座上如來坐。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b13\">0023b13</span><p class=\"lg\">種種嚴飾吉祥門，<caesura/>恒放燈光寶焰雲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b14\">0023b14</span><p class=\"lg\">廣大熾然無不照，<caesura/>牟尼處上增嚴好。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b15\">0023b15</span><p class=\"lg\">種種摩尼綺麗窓，<caesura/>妙寶蓮華所垂飾，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b16\">0023b16</span><p class=\"lg\">恒出妙音聞者悅，<caesura/>佛坐其上特明顯。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b17\">0023b17</span><p class=\"lg\">寶輪承座半月形，<caesura/>金剛為臺色焰明，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b18\">0023b18</span><p class=\"lg\">持髻菩薩常圍遶，<caesura/>佛在其中最光<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0023003\">耀＝曜【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0023003\">耀【大】＊，曜【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0023003\"><p class=\"lg\">耀</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">曜</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b19\">0023b19</span><p class=\"lg\">種種變化滿十方，<caesura/>演說如來廣大願，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b20\">0023b20</span><p class=\"lg\">一切影像於中現，<caesura/>如是座上佛安坐。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b21\">0023b21</span><p>爾時，雷音普震菩薩摩訶薩，承佛威力，普觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b22\">0023b22</span>一切道場眾海，<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0023004\">即＝而【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0023004\">即【大】＊，而【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0023004\"><p class=\"lg\">即</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">而</rdg></app>說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b23\">0023b23</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「世尊往集菩提行，<caesura/>供養十方無量佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b24\">0023b24</span><p class=\"lg\">善逝威力所加持，<caesura/>如來座中無不覩。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b25\">0023b25</span><p class=\"lg\">香焰摩尼如意王，<caesura/>填飾妙華師子座，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b26\">0023b26</span><p class=\"lg\">種種莊嚴皆影現，<caesura/>一切眾會悉明矚。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b27\">0023b27</span><p class=\"lg\">佛座普現莊嚴相，<caesura/>念念色類各差別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b28\">0023b28</span><p class=\"lg\">隨諸眾生解不同，<caesura/>各見佛坐於其上。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023b29\">0023b29</span><p class=\"lg\">寶枝垂布蓮華網，<caesura/>華開<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0023005\">踊＝涌【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0023005\">踊【大】，涌【宮】</span><app n=\"0023005\"><p class=\"lg\">踊</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">涌</rdg></app>現諸菩薩，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c01\">0023c01</span><p class=\"lg\">各出微妙悅意聲，<caesura/>稱讚如來坐於座。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c02\">0023c02</span><p class=\"lg\">佛功德量如虛空，<caesura/>一切莊嚴從此生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c03\">0023c03</span><p class=\"lg\">一一地中嚴飾事，<caesura/>一切眾生不能了。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c04\">0023c04</span><p class=\"lg\">金剛為地無能壞，<caesura/>廣博清淨極夷坦，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c05\">0023c05</span><p class=\"lg\">摩尼為網垂布空，<caesura/>菩提樹下皆周遍。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c06\">0023c06</span><p class=\"lg\">其地無邊色相殊，<caesura/>真金為末布其中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c07\">0023c07</span><p class=\"lg\">普散名華及眾寶，<caesura/>悉以光瑩如來座。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c08\">0023c08</span><p class=\"lg\">地神歡喜而踊躍，<caesura/>剎那示現無有盡，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c09\">0023c09</span><p class=\"lg\">普興一切莊嚴雲，<caesura/>恒在佛前瞻仰住。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c10\">0023c10</span><p class=\"lg\">寶燈廣大極熾然，<caesura/>香焰流光無斷絕，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c11\">0023c11</span><p class=\"lg\">隨時示現各差別，<caesura/>地神以此為供養。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c12\">0023c12</span><p class=\"lg\">十方一切剎土中，<caesura/>彼地所有諸莊嚴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c13\">0023c13</span><p class=\"lg\">今此道場無不現，<caesura/>以佛威神故能爾。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c14\">0023c14</span><p>爾時，眾寶光明髻菩薩摩訶薩，承佛威力，普\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c15\">0023c15</span>觀一切道場眾海，<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0023004\"><p class=\"lg\">即</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">而</rdg></app>說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c16\">0023c16</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「世尊往昔修行時，<caesura/>見諸佛土皆圓滿，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c17\">0023c17</span><p class=\"lg\">如是所見地無盡，<caesura/>此道場中皆顯現。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c18\">0023c18</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊廣大神通力，<caesura/>舒光普雨摩尼寶，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c19\">0023c19</span><p class=\"lg\">如是寶藏散道場，<caesura/>其地周迴悉嚴麗。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c20\">0023c20</span><p class=\"lg\">如來福德神通力，<caesura/>摩尼妙寶普莊嚴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c21\">0023c21</span><p class=\"lg\">其地及以菩提樹，<caesura/>遞發光音而演說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c22\">0023c22</span><p class=\"lg\">寶燈無量從空雨，<caesura/>寶王間錯為嚴飾，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c23\">0023c23</span><p class=\"lg\">悉吐微妙演法音，<caesura/>如是地神之所現。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c24\">0023c24</span><p class=\"lg\">寶地普現妙光雲，<caesura/>寶炬焰明如電發，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c25\">0023c25</span><p class=\"lg\">寶網遐張覆其上，<caesura/>寶枝雜布為嚴好。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c26\">0023c26</span><p class=\"lg\">汝等普觀於此地，<caesura/>種種妙寶所莊嚴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c27\">0023c27</span><p class=\"lg\">顯示眾生諸業海，<caesura/>令彼了知真法性。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c28\">0023c28</span><p class=\"lg\">普遍十方一切佛，<caesura/>所有圓滿菩提樹，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0023c29\">0023c29</span><p class=\"lg\">莫不皆現道場中，<caesura/>演說如來清淨法。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a01\">0024a01</span><p class=\"lg\">隨諸眾生心所樂，<caesura/>其地普出妙音聲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a02\">0024a02</span><p class=\"lg\">如佛座上所應演，<caesura/>一一法門咸具說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a03\">0024a03</span><p class=\"lg\">其地恒出妙香光，<caesura/>光中普演清淨音，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a04\">0024a04</span><p class=\"lg\">若有眾生堪受法，<caesura/>悉使得聞煩惱滅。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a05\">0024a05</span><p class=\"lg\">一一莊嚴悉圓滿，<caesura/>假使億劫無能說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a06\">0024a06</span><p class=\"lg\">如來神力靡不周，<caesura/>是故其地皆嚴淨。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a07\">0024a07</span><p>爾時，大智日勇猛慧菩薩摩訶薩，承佛威力，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a08\">0024a08</span>普觀一切道場眾海，<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0023004\"><p class=\"lg\">即</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">而</rdg></app>說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a09\">0024a09</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「世尊凝<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0024001\">明註曰睟南藏作眸</span><app n=\"0024001\"><p class=\"lg\">睟</lem><rdg resp=\"【明】\" wit=\"【南藏】\">眸</rdg></app>處法堂，<caesura/>炳然照耀宮殿中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a10\">0024a10</span><p class=\"lg\">隨諸眾生心所樂，<caesura/>其身普現十方土。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a11\">0024a11</span><p class=\"lg\">如來宮殿不思議，<caesura/>摩尼寶藏為嚴飾，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a12\">0024a12</span><p class=\"lg\">諸莊嚴具咸光耀，<caesura/>佛坐其中特明顯。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a13\">0024a13</span><p class=\"lg\">摩尼為柱種種色，<caesura/>真金鈴鐸如雲布，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a14\">0024a14</span><p class=\"lg\">寶階四面列成行，<caesura/>門闥隨方咸洞啟。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a15\">0024a15</span><p class=\"lg\">妙華繒綺莊嚴帳，<caesura/>寶樹枝條共嚴飾，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a16\">0024a16</span><p class=\"lg\">摩尼瓔珞四面垂，<caesura/>智海於中湛然坐。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a17\">0024a17</span><p class=\"lg\">摩尼為網妙香幢，<caesura/>光焰燈明若雲布，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a18\">0024a18</span><p class=\"lg\">覆以種種莊嚴具，<caesura/>超世正知於此坐。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a19\">0024a19</span><p class=\"lg\">十方普現變化雲，<caesura/>其雲演說遍世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a20\">0024a20</span><p class=\"lg\">一切眾生悉調伏，<caesura/>如是皆從佛宮現。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a21\">0024a21</span><p class=\"lg\">摩尼為樹發妙華，<caesura/>十方所有無能匹，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a22\">0024a22</span><p class=\"lg\">三世國土莊嚴事，<caesura/>莫不於中現其影。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a23\">0024a23</span><p class=\"lg\">處處皆有摩尼聚，<caesura/>光焰熾然無量種，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a24\">0024a24</span><p class=\"lg\">門牖隨方相間開，<caesura/>棟宇莊嚴極殊麗。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a25\">0024a25</span><p class=\"lg\">如來宮殿不思議，<caesura/>清淨光明具眾相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a26\">0024a26</span><p class=\"lg\">一切宮殿於中現，<caesura/>一一皆有如來坐。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a27\">0024a27</span><p class=\"lg\">如來宮殿無有邊，<caesura/>自然覺者處其中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a28\">0024a28</span><p class=\"lg\">十方一切諸眾會，<caesura/>莫不向佛而來集。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024a29\">0024a29</span><p>爾時，不思議功德寶智印菩薩摩訶薩，承佛\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b01\">0024b01</span>威力，普觀一切道場眾海，即說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b02\">0024b02</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「佛昔修治眾福海，<caesura/>一切剎土微塵數，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b03\">0024b03</span><p class=\"lg\">神通願力所出生，<caesura/>道場嚴淨無諸垢。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b04\">0024b04</span><p class=\"lg\">如意珠<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0024002\">王＝玉【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0024002\">王【大】，玉【宮】</span><app n=\"0024002\"><p class=\"lg\">王</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">玉</rdg></app>作樹根，<caesura/>金剛摩尼以為身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b05\">0024b05</span><p class=\"lg\">寶網遐施覆其上，<caesura/>妙香氛氳共旋繞。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b06\">0024b06</span><p class=\"lg\">樹枝嚴飾備眾寶，<caesura/>摩尼為幹爭聳擢，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b07\">0024b07</span><p class=\"lg\">枝條密布如重雲，<caesura/>佛於其下坐道場。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b08\">0024b08</span><p class=\"lg\">道場廣大不思議，<caesura/>其樹周迴盡彌覆，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b09\">0024b09</span><p class=\"lg\">密葉繁華相庇映，<caesura/>華中悉結摩尼果。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b10\">0024b10</span><p class=\"lg\">一切枝間發妙光，<caesura/>其光遍照道場中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b11\">0024b11</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨熾然無有盡，<caesura/>以佛願力如斯<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0024003\">覩＝現【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0024003\">覩【大】，現【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0024003\"><p class=\"lg\">覩</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">現</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b12\">0024b12</span><p class=\"lg\">摩尼寶藏以為華，<caesura/>布影騰<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0024004\">輝＝暉【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0024004\">輝【大】，暉【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0024004\"><p class=\"lg\">輝</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">暉</rdg></app>若綺雲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b13\">0024b13</span><p class=\"lg\">匝樹垂芳無不遍，<caesura/>於道場中普嚴飾。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b14\">0024b14</span><p class=\"lg\">汝觀善逝道場中，<caesura/>蓮華寶網俱清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b15\">0024b15</span><p class=\"lg\">光焰成輪從此現，<caesura/>鈴音鐸響雲間發。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b16\">0024b16</span><p class=\"lg\">十方一切國土中，<caesura/>所有妙色莊嚴樹，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b17\">0024b17</span><p class=\"lg\">菩提樹中無不現，<caesura/>佛於其下離眾垢。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b18\">0024b18</span><p class=\"lg\">道場廣大福所成，<caesura/>樹枝雨寶恒無盡，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b19\">0024b19</span><p class=\"lg\">寶中出現諸菩薩，<caesura/>悉往十方供事佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b20\">0024b20</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛境界不思議，<caesura/>普令其樹出樂音，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b21\">0024b21</span><p class=\"lg\">如昔所集菩提道，<caesura/>眾會聞音咸得見。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b22\">0024b22</span><p>爾時，百目蓮華髻菩薩摩訶薩，承佛威力，普\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b23\">0024b23</span>觀一切道場眾海，<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0023004\"><p class=\"lg\">即</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">而</rdg></app>說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b24\">0024b24</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「一切摩尼出妙音，<caesura/>稱揚三世諸佛名，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b25\">0024b25</span><p class=\"lg\">彼佛無量神通事，<caesura/>此道場中皆現覩。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b26\">0024b26</span><p class=\"lg\">眾華競發如纓布，<caesura/>光雲流演遍十方，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b27\">0024b27</span><p class=\"lg\">菩提樹神持向佛，<caesura/>一心瞻仰為供養。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b28\">0024b28</span><p class=\"lg\">摩尼光焰悉成幢，<caesura/>幢中熾然發妙香，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024b29\">0024b29</span><p class=\"lg\">其香普熏一切眾，<caesura/>是故其處皆嚴潔。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c01\">0024c01</span><p class=\"lg\">蓮華垂布金色光，<caesura/>其光演佛妙聲雲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c02\">0024c02</span><p class=\"lg\">普蔭十方諸剎土，<caesura/>永息眾生煩惱熱。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c03\">0024c03</span><p class=\"lg\">菩提樹王自在力，<caesura/>常放光明極清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c04\">0024c04</span><p class=\"lg\">十方眾會無有邊，<caesura/>莫不影現道場中。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c05\">0024c05</span><p class=\"lg\">寶枝光焰若明燈，<caesura/>其光演音宣大願，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c06\">0024c06</span><p class=\"lg\">如佛往昔於諸有，<caesura/>本所修行皆具說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c07\">0024c07</span><p class=\"lg\">樹下諸神剎塵數，<caesura/>悉共依於此道場，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c08\">0024c08</span><p class=\"lg\">各各如來道樹前，<caesura/>念念宣揚解脫門。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c09\">0024c09</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊往昔修諸行，<caesura/>供養一切諸如來，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c10\">0024c10</span><p class=\"lg\">本所修行及名聞，<caesura/>摩尼寶中皆悉現。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c11\">0024c11</span><p class=\"lg\">道場一切出妙音，<caesura/>其音廣大遍十方，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c12\">0024c12</span><p class=\"lg\">若有眾生堪受法，<caesura/>莫不調伏令清淨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c13\">0024c13</span><p class=\"lg\">如來往昔普修治，<caesura/>一切無量莊嚴事，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c14\">0024c14</span><p class=\"lg\">十方一切菩提樹，<caesura/>一一莊嚴無量種。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c15\">0024c15</span><p>爾時，金焰圓滿光菩薩摩訶薩，承佛威力，普\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c16\">0024c16</span>觀一切道場眾海，<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0023004\"><p class=\"lg\">即</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">而</rdg></app>說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c17\">0024c17</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「佛昔修習菩提行，<caesura/>於諸境界解明了，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c18\">0024c18</span><p class=\"lg\">處與非處淨無疑，<caesura/>此是如來初智力。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c19\">0024c19</span><p class=\"lg\">如昔等觀諸法性，<caesura/>一切業海皆明徹，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c20\">0024c20</span><p class=\"lg\">如是今於光網中，<caesura/>普遍十方能具演。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c21\">0024c21</span><p class=\"lg\">往劫修治大方便，<caesura/>隨眾生根而化誘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c22\">0024c22</span><p class=\"lg\">普使眾會心清淨，<caesura/>故佛能成根智力。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c23\">0024c23</span><p class=\"lg\">如諸眾生解不同，<caesura/>欲樂諸行各差別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c24\">0024c24</span><p class=\"lg\">隨其所應為說法，<caesura/>佛以智力能如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c25\">0024c25</span><p class=\"lg\">普盡十方諸剎海，<caesura/>所有一切眾生界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c26\">0024c26</span><p class=\"lg\">佛智平等如虛空，<caesura/>悉能顯現毛孔中。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c27\">0024c27</span><p class=\"lg\">一切處行佛盡知，<caesura/>一念三世畢無餘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c28\">0024c28</span><p class=\"lg\">十方剎劫眾生時，<caesura/>悉能開示令現了。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0024c29\">0024c29</span><p class=\"lg\">禪定解脫力無邊，<caesura/>三昧方便亦復然，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a01\">0025a01</span><p class=\"lg\">佛為示現令歡喜，<caesura/>普使滌除煩惱闇。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a02\">0025a02</span><p class=\"lg\">佛智無礙包三世，<caesura/>剎那悉現毛孔中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a03\">0025a03</span><p class=\"lg\">佛法國土及眾生，<caesura/>所現皆由隨念力。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a04\">0025a04</span><p class=\"lg\">佛眼廣大如虛空，<caesura/>普見法界盡無餘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a05\">0025a05</span><p class=\"lg\">無礙地中無等用，<caesura/>彼眼無量佛能演。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a06\">0025a06</span><p class=\"lg\">一切眾生具諸結，<caesura/>所有隨眠與習氣，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a07\">0025a07</span><p class=\"lg\">如來出現遍世間，<caesura/>悉以方便令除滅。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a08\">0025a08</span><p>爾時，法界普音菩薩摩訶薩，承佛威力，普觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a09\">0025a09</span>一切道場眾會海已，即說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a10\">0025a10</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「佛威神力遍十方，<caesura/>廣大示現無分別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a11\">0025a11</span><p class=\"lg\">大菩提行波羅蜜，<caesura/>昔所滿足皆令見。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a12\">0025a12</span><p class=\"lg\">昔於眾生起大悲，<caesura/>修行布施波羅蜜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a13\">0025a13</span><p class=\"lg\">以是其身最殊妙，<caesura/>能令見者生歡喜。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a14\">0025a14</span><p class=\"lg\">昔在無邊大劫海，<caesura/>修治淨戒波羅蜜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a15\">0025a15</span><p class=\"lg\">故獲淨身遍十方，<caesura/>普滅世間諸重苦。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a16\">0025a16</span><p class=\"lg\">往昔修行忍清淨，<caesura/>信解真實無分別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a17\">0025a17</span><p class=\"lg\">是故色相皆圓滿，<caesura/>普放光明照十方。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a18\">0025a18</span><p class=\"lg\">往昔勤修多劫海，<caesura/>能轉眾生深重障，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a19\">0025a19</span><p class=\"lg\">故能分身遍十方，<caesura/>悉現菩提樹王下。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a20\">0025a20</span><p class=\"lg\">佛久修行無量劫，<caesura/>禪定大海普清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a21\">0025a21</span><p class=\"lg\">故令見者<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025001\">深＝心【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025001\">深【大】，心【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0025001\"><p class=\"lg\">深</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">心</rdg></app>歡喜，<caesura/>煩惱障垢悉除滅。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a22\">0025a22</span><p class=\"lg\">如來往修諸行海，<caesura/>具足般若波羅蜜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a23\">0025a23</span><p class=\"lg\">是故舒光普照明，<caesura/>克殄一切愚癡暗。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a24\">0025a24</span><p class=\"lg\">種種方便化眾生，<caesura/>令所修治悉成就，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a25\">0025a25</span><p class=\"lg\">一切十方皆遍往，<caesura/>無邊際劫不休息。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a26\">0025a26</span><p class=\"lg\">佛昔修行大劫海，<caesura/>淨治諸願波羅蜜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a27\">0025a27</span><p class=\"lg\">是故出現遍世間，<caesura/>盡未來際救眾生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a28\">0025a28</span><p class=\"lg\">佛無量劫廣修治，<caesura/>一切法力波羅蜜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025a29\">0025a29</span><p class=\"lg\">由是能成自然力，<caesura/>普現十方諸國土。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b01\">0025b01</span><p class=\"lg\">佛昔修治普門智，<caesura/>一切智性如虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b02\">0025b02</span><p class=\"lg\">是故得成無礙力，<caesura/>舒光普照十方剎。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b03\">0025b03</span><p>爾時，雲音淨月菩薩摩訶薩，承佛威力，普觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b04\">0025b04</span>一切道場眾<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025002\">〔會〕－【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025002\">會【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0025002\"><p class=\"lg\">會</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>海<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025003\">〔已〕－【元】【明】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025003\">已【大】，〔－〕【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0025003\"><p class=\"lg\">已</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】 【宮】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>，即說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b05\">0025b05</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「神通境界等虛空，<caesura/>十方眾生靡不見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b06\">0025b06</span><p class=\"lg\">如昔修行所成地，<caesura/>摩尼果中咸具說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b07\">0025b07</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨勤修無量劫，<caesura/>入於初地極歡喜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b08\">0025b08</span><p class=\"lg\">出生法界廣大智，<caesura/>普見十方無量佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b09\">0025b09</span><p class=\"lg\">一切法中離垢地，<caesura/>等眾生數持淨戒，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b10\">0025b10</span><p class=\"lg\">已於多劫廣修行，<caesura/>供養無邊諸佛海。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b11\">0025b11</span><p class=\"lg\">積集福德發光地，<caesura/>奢摩他藏堅固忍，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b12\">0025b12</span><p class=\"lg\">法雲廣大悉已聞，<caesura/>摩尼果中如是說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b13\">0025b13</span><p class=\"lg\">焰海慧明無等地，<caesura/>善了境界起慈悲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b14\">0025b14</span><p class=\"lg\">一切國土平等身，<caesura/>如佛所治皆演暢。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b15\">0025b15</span><p class=\"lg\">普藏等門難勝地，<caesura/>動寂相順無違<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025004\">返＝反【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025004\">反【CB】【宋】【元】【明】【宮】，返【大】</span><app n=\"0025004\"><p class=\"lg\">反</lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">返</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">反</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b16\">0025b16</span><p class=\"lg\">佛法境界悉平等，<caesura/>如佛所淨皆能說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b17\">0025b17</span><p class=\"lg\">廣大修行慧海地，<caesura/>一切法門咸遍了，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b18\">0025b18</span><p class=\"lg\">普現國土如虛空，<caesura/>樹中演暢此法音。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b19\">0025b19</span><p class=\"lg\">周遍法界虛空身，<caesura/>普照眾生智慧燈，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b20\">0025b20</span><p class=\"lg\">一切方便皆清淨，<caesura/>昔所遠行<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025005\">令＝今【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025005\">令【大】，今【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0025005\"><p class=\"lg\">令</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">今</rdg></app>具演。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b21\">0025b21</span><p class=\"lg\">一切願行所莊嚴，<caesura/>無量剎海皆清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b22\">0025b22</span><p class=\"lg\">所有分別無能動，<caesura/>此無等地咸宣說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b23\">0025b23</span><p class=\"lg\">無量境界神通力，<caesura/>善入教法光明力，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b24\">0025b24</span><p class=\"lg\">此是清淨善慧地，<caesura/>劫海所行皆備闡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b25\">0025b25</span><p class=\"lg\">法雲廣大第十地，<caesura/>含藏一切遍虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b26\">0025b26</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛境界聲中演，<caesura/>此聲是佛威神力。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b27\">0025b27</span><p>爾時，善勇猛光幢菩薩摩訶薩，承佛<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025006\">威神＝威力【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025006\">威神【大】，威力【宮】</span><app n=\"0025006\"><p class=\"lg\">威神</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">威力</rdg></app>，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b28\">0025b28</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025007\">（（觀察十方））四字＝（（普觀一切道場眾海））八字【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025007\">觀察十方【大】，普觀一切道場眾海【宮】</span><app n=\"0025007\"><p class=\"lg\">觀察十方</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">普觀一切道場眾海</rdg></app>，<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0023004\"><p class=\"lg\">即</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">而</rdg></app>說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025b29\">0025b29</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「無量眾生處會中，<caesura/>種種信解心清淨，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c01\">0025c01</span><p class=\"lg\">悉能悟入如來智，<caesura/>了達一切莊嚴境。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c02\">0025c02</span><p class=\"lg\">各起淨願修諸行，<caesura/>悉曾供養無量佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c03\">0025c03</span><p class=\"lg\">能見如來真實體，<caesura/>及以一切諸神變。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c04\">0025c04</span><p class=\"lg\">或有能見佛法身，<caesura/>無等無礙普周遍，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c05\">0025c05</span><p class=\"lg\">所有無邊諸法性，<caesura/>悉入其身無不盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c06\">0025c06</span><p class=\"lg\">或有見佛妙色身，<caesura/>無邊色相光熾然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c07\">0025c07</span><p class=\"lg\">隨諸眾生解不同，<caesura/>種種變現十方中。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c08\">0025c08</span><p class=\"lg\">或見無礙智慧身，<caesura/>三世平等如虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c09\">0025c09</span><p class=\"lg\">普隨眾生心樂轉，<caesura/>種種差別皆令見。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c10\">0025c10</span><p class=\"lg\">或有能了佛音聲，<caesura/>普遍十方諸國土，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c11\">0025c11</span><p class=\"lg\">隨諸眾生所應解，<caesura/>為出言音無障礙。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c12\">0025c12</span><p class=\"lg\">或見如來種種光，<caesura/>種種照耀遍世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c13\">0025c13</span><p class=\"lg\">或有於佛光明中，<caesura/>復見諸佛現神通。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c14\">0025c14</span><p class=\"lg\">或有見佛海雲光，<caesura/>從毛孔出色熾然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c15\">0025c15</span><p class=\"lg\">示現往昔修行道，<caesura/>令生深信入佛智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c16\">0025c16</span><p class=\"lg\">或見佛相福莊嚴，<caesura/>及見此福所從生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c17\">0025c17</span><p class=\"lg\">往昔修行諸度海，<caesura/>皆佛相中明了見。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c18\">0025c18</span><p class=\"lg\">如來功德不可量，<caesura/>充滿法界無邊際，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c19\">0025c19</span><p class=\"lg\">及以神通諸境界，<caesura/>以佛力故能宣說。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c20\">0025c20</span><p>爾時，華藏莊嚴世界海，以佛神力，其地一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c21\">0025c21</span>六種、十八相震動。所謂：動、遍動、普遍動；起、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c22\">0025c22</span>遍起、普遍起；<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025008\">涌＝踊【三】＊【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0025008\">涌【大】＊，踊【宋】＊【元】＊【明】＊【宮】</span><app n=\"0025008\"><p class=\"lg\">涌</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">踊</rdg></app>、遍<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0025008\"><p class=\"lg\">涌</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">踊</rdg></app>、普遍<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0025008\"><p class=\"lg\">涌</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">踊</rdg></app>；震、遍震、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c23\">0025c23</span>普遍震；吼、遍吼、普遍吼；擊、遍擊、普遍擊。此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c24\">0025c24</span>諸世主，一一皆現不思議諸供養雲，雨於如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c25\">0025c25</span>來道場眾海。所謂：一切香華莊嚴雲、一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c26\">0025c26</span>摩尼妙飾雲、一切寶焰華網雲、無邊種類摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c27\">0025c27</span>尼寶圓光雲、一切眾色寶真珠藏雲、一切寶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c28\">0025c28</span>栴檀香雲、一切寶蓋雲、清淨妙聲摩尼王雲、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0025c29\">0025c29</span>日光摩尼瓔珞輪雲、一切寶光明藏雲、一切\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a01\">0026a01</span>各別莊嚴具雲……。如是等諸供養雲，其數無量\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a02\">0026a02</span>不可思議。此諸世主，一一皆現如是供養雲，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a03\">0026a03</span>雨於如來道場眾海，靡不周遍。如此世界中，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a04\">0026a04</span>一一世主，心生歡喜，如是供養；其華藏莊嚴\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a05\">0026a05</span>世界海中，一切世界所有世主，悉亦如是而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a06\">0026a06</span>為供養。其一切世界中，悉有如來坐於道場；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a07\">0026a07</span>一一世主，各各信解，各各所緣，各各三昧方\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a08\">0026a08</span>便門，各各修習助道法，各各成就，各各歡喜，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a09\">0026a09</span>各各趣入，各各悟解諸法門，各各入如來神\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a10\">0026a10</span>通境界，各各入如來力境界，各各入如來解\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a11\">0026a11</span>脫門。如於此華藏世界海，十方盡法界、虛空\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a12\">0026a12</span>界、一切世界海中，悉亦如是。</p></cb:div></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0026a13\">0026a13</span><cb:juan n=\"005\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大方廣佛華嚴經</title>卷第五</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n</body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}